sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Authenticated User
    participant API as Express API
    participant S as Membership Service
    participant DB as MongoDB Replica Set
    participant SSE as Outbox Dispatcher
    U->>API: POST invite/redeem (cookie, CSRF, idempotency key)
    API->>S: Validate and admit
    S->>DB: Begin transaction; check eligibility and token
    S->>DB: Conditional team count increment if count < max
    alt Seat available and membership unique
        S->>DB: Insert membership; consume invite; audit; outbox; idempotency
        S->>DB: Commit transaction
        DB-->>S: Committed
        S-->>API: 200 membership
        API-->>U: Success
        SSE->>DB: Poll committed outbox
        SSE-->>U: member.joined signal; client refetches
    else Team full or user already in a team
        S->>DB: Abort transaction
        S-->>API: 409 conflict
        API-->>U: Clear error + client refetch
    end
    Note over S,DB: Transient transaction write conflicts retried; no external calls inside transaction.
